    {
      "name": "Optional lesson video",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Default-open preview of the divided resource row after written teaching. The app lazy-loads the privacy-enhanced player without autoplay; controls above close or show it. Closing or changing stages unloads it. No completion credit. This self-contained placeholder makes no external player request.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-video\"><div class=\"ds-video-heading\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"/></svg><div><h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T_6Mq6PWoGc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Basic Math Review</a></h3><p class=\"ds-video-source\">The Organic Chemistry Tutor · YouTube</p></div></div><p>Optional extra study. Pause to solve the examples on paper, then try this section’s practice questions.</p><div class=\"ds-video-actions\"><button class=\"ds-video-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>Close video player</button><a class=\"ds-video-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T_6Mq6PWoGc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open on YouTube</a></div><div class=\"ds-video-player\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"External video player preview placeholder\"><svg width=\"44\" height=\"44\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"9 5 20 12 9 19 9 5\"/></svg><span>Video preview</span></div><p class=\"ds-video-note\">If the player is unavailable, use “Open on YouTube” above.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-video{padding-block:20px;border-block:1px solid var(--line,#dce2d7);color:var(--ink,#24382d);font:14px/1.6 var(--font-public-sans,Arial),sans-serif}.ds-video-heading{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.ds-video-heading>svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;color:var(--forest,#244d3c)}.ds-video-heading>div{min-width:0}.ds-video-heading h3{margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.015em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-video-heading h3 a{color:var(--forest,#244d3c);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-video-source{color:var(--muted,#627066);font-size:13px;margin-block:5px 0}.ds-video-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}.ds-video-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2d7);border-radius:var(--small-radius,6px);background:transparent;color:var(--forest,#244d3c);font:560 12px/1.4 var(--font-public-sans,Arial),sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 140ms ease-out,transform 140ms ease-out}.ds-video-button:hover{background:var(--sage,#e5ecdc)}.ds-video-button:active{transform:scale(.96)}.ds-video-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-size:12px;font-weight:560;color:var(--forest,#244d3c);text-decoration:none}.ds-video-link:hover{color:var(--forest-hover,#173b2b);text-decoration:underline}.ds-video a:focus-visible,.ds-video-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--forest,#244d3c);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-video-button{transition-duration:.01ms}}.ds-video-player{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;width:100%;min-height:200px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2d7);margin-top:20px;background:var(--ink,#24382d);color:var(--white,#fff)}.ds-video-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#627066)}"
